{"availability":"available","full":"Techspell01/voc","name":"voc","description":"Speak in Malayalam or Manglish: get an English email, a live-writing sticky note, or your to-dos, dates and shop orders. React PWA + Vercel.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-08T19:13:37Z","updated":"2026-10-08T19:14:10Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://usevoc.vercel.app","topics":["gemini","malayalam","manglish","mcp","pwa","react","speech-to-text","vercel"],"demo":"https://usevoc.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:24.529Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:24.529Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:24.529Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:24.529Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Speak in Malayalam. Get an English email, a sticky note, or your lists and dates. Live:","In Kerala, voice notes run everything: a customer's order to the kirana shop, Amma's list for the way home, a boss's instructions. They come in Manglish, Malayalam and English mixed mid-sentence, and someone has to listen and write it all down. Voc (short for voice) does that:","\"Chetta, randu kilo ari, arakilo cheriya ulli, pathu mutta venam. Nale raavile ethikkanam. Pinne velliyazhcha 5 manikku Ammede doctor appointment und.\""],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Techspell01/voc/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"4d1d8b8d0434c41a87e1132d09aaf2bfe576f349613e93321c98f2577bf52808","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:24.698Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:24.698Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Speak in Malayalam. Get an English email, a sticky note, or your lists and dates. Live:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Techspell01/voc/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Zepto and Swiggy Instamart go further, through their official MCP servers: sign in once on